  "Grounded in the Great Lakes region.": "m69514288b78e",
  "Growing up and working in the Great Lakes region has made me attentive to the complexity of places that are often described through a narrow lens. In Goma, conflict and uncertainty are part of the reality, but so are creativity, entrepreneurship, humour, culture, solidarity and ambition.": "m6876da367b03",
