  "Humanitarian storytelling": "m4364deb54505",
  "I agree to be contacted in response to this enquiry. My details will only be used to continue this conversation.": "mfc0431c7a3a5",
  "I aim to distinguish personal perspectives from verified facts, give context to the issues I discuss and remain open to new information and different points of view.": "ma2ac240e1f73",
  "I am always interested in connecting with people who care about stories, ideas, communication and the possibilities of creative collaboration. If you are an editor looking to discuss a story, a communications professional interested in working together, an organisation exploring a project, or simply someone with an idea worth sharing, I would be glad to hear from you.": "meb500018a3de",
  "I am interested in building platforms, supporting meaningful initiatives and producing work that connects local experiences with wider conversations.": "me8dd2fcdfaec",
  "I am interested in initiatives that use creativity, technology, communication and local knowledge to address challenges and create opportunities.": "md33d09da1f57",
  "I believe that where a story comes from should never limit how far it can travel.": "m8a9982770de1",
  "I develop stories that bring people, experiences and ideas closer to audiences, with a particular interest in African narratives and human-centred reporting.": "md34a1f3c8f6f",
  "I enjoy taking an idea from its early stages and turning it into something tangible: an article, a campaign, a story, a digital experience or a project that connects with people.": "m1455404ccaac",
  "I help transform ideas, projects and objectives into clear communication strategies, engaging content and meaningful messages for different audiences.": "m2e60cd9c195e",
  "I want to contribute to a broader understanding of these realities. Not by ignoring difficult truths, but by making room for the full picture.": "m75f0515e7c8b",
  "I want to explore the people, creativity, businesses, cultures and ideas that make our communities what they are.": "m2a9821b65103",
  "I want to keep growing as a communications professional, develop my voice as a writer and contribute to media that takes African perspectives seriously.": "m447766f229b6",
