  "My experience includes engagement with youth-focused, community and civil-society initiatives. I am interested in the ways young people organise, create, communicate and develop solutions in their communities.": "mc1ed546f9cbd",
  "My journey & field philosophy.": "m9fab9f556663",
  "My name is": "mdeb83494817d",
  "My portfolio brings together selected examples of my work in strategic communication, digital media, editorial storytelling and project visibility. Each project represents an opportunity to communicate an idea, document an experience or help an audience understand an issue more clearly.": "mf87c08b7e4ec",
  "My professional experience in humanitarian and development communication has shown me the importance of connecting programme activities with the people and experiences behind them.": "mb5f7fe4c29e3",
  "My professional journey has brought me into humanitarian communication, digital media, editorial storytelling and community-focused initiatives. I work across communication planning, content creation, social media, photography, video, reporting and the development of stories that help audiences understand people and projects beyond statistics.": "mcc2e14f0217b",
  "My role, collaborators and selected outputs will be documented.": "m05962a8125e7",
  "My work is an ongoing attempt to document these realities, ask better questions and contribute to a richer understanding of the places we call home.": "m906dbc23d16f",
  "My work sits at the intersection of communication, media, storytelling and community-driven initiatives. Through writing, digital content, campaigns and multimedia, I explore how stories can help people understand one another, discover new perspectives and see possibilities beyond the headlines.": "mc636d20bf572",
